1Pe 2:1 , He exhorts them from the breach of charity;
1Pe 2:4 , shewing that Christ is the foundation whereupon they are built;
1Pe 2:11 , He beseeches them also to abstain from fleshly lusts;
1Pe 2:13 , to be obedient to magistrates;
1Pe 2:18 , and teaches servants how to obey their masters;
1Pe 2:20 , patiently suffering for well doing, after the example of Christ.
